+## V14 implementation update — Retention + outcome moat
+
+### Phase 3 / 4 retention loop
+- Locked weekly benchmark tied to a target application.
+- Application cockpit with countdown, next best action, comeback queue and adherence.
+- Weekly benchmark persistence through Supabase Auth/RLS.
+
+### Phase 7 calibration
+- Mock-to-real outcome pairing for the same application.
+- Readiness evidence-confidence score separate from readiness itself.
+- Personal descriptive benchmark only after enough paired outcomes; no pass-probability claim.
+
+### Phase 9 data moat
+- Optional anonymous structured process contribution.
+- Server-managed aggregate process-report store.
+- Company/role intelligence hidden below a configurable privacy threshold (default 5).
+- Evidence labels based on sample size.
+- Exact questions, answers, SQL, transcripts, resume/JD text and private notes are excluded from aggregate intelligence.
+
+Next evidence-driven depth:
+1. learn whether weekly benchmarks improve 7-day retention,
+2. calibrate company/role thresholds only with enough consented reports,
+3. add peer mocks only after individual practice retention is proven,
+4. add instructor/cohort views only after B2C usage patterns are stable.
